  "title": "Warm Spicy Tunisian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A hearty and spicy North African stew originating from Tunisia, made with lamb, fermented chilies, and fragrant pandan leaf. Serve hot over crusty bread or couscous for a satisfying meal.",
