  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the bottom of a large clay or ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the fermented chilies and pandan leaves. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1.5 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Serve hot over crusty bread or couscous."
  ],
